{% from "approved-en/photo.njk" import photo %}
<div class="en-continuation">
  <section id="situations" class="en-situations" aria-labelledby="situations-title">
    <div class="en-situations-intro">
      <div class="en-situations-intro-inner">
        <h2 id="situations-title">Situations</h2>
        <p>You can choose tailored protection before a known incident. A separation, business dispute or inheritance conflict can make the need more immediate.</p>
        <div class="en-exposure-teaser">
          <p>Three drives to the same unfamiliar neighborhood, logged in Waze. Furniture ads on Instagram. Two calls to a moving company.</p>
          <p>Put those together. What would someone guess you’re planning?</p>
          <p class="en-context-link"><a href="/en/exposure/#what-apps-reveal">See what your apps can reveal</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="en-situation-sequence">
      <article class="en-situation-scene en-situation-scene--separation" aria-labelledby="situation-separation">
        <figure class="en-situation-image">{{ photo({src: '/approved-en-assets/photos/sit-1-900.jpg', srcset: '/approved-en-assets/photos/sit-1-900.jpg 900w', sizes: '(max-width: 700px) 94vw, 65vw', width: 900, height: 1500, alt: '', variant: 'scene', priority: 'lazy'}) }}</figure>
        <div class="en-situation-title-panel"><h3 id="situation-separation"><a href="/en/separation-divorce/">Separation</a></h3>
          {% set separationHero = siteContent.en.pages["separation-divorce"].blocks[0] %}
          <p class="en-situation-description">{{ separationHero.card_lead or separationHero.lead }}</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="en-situation-scene en-situation-scene--business" aria-labelledby="situation-business">
        <figure class="en-situation-image">{{ photo({src: '/approved-en-assets/photos/sit-2-900.jpg', srcset: '/approved-en-assets/photos/sit-2-900.jpg 900w', sizes: '(max-width: 700px) 91vw, 72vw', width: 900, height: 1500, alt: '', variant: 'scene', priority: 'lazy'}) }}</figure>
        <div class="en-situation-title-panel"><h3 id="situation-business"><a href="/en/business-dispute/">Business dispute</a></h3>
          <p class="en-situation-description">{{ siteContent.en.pages["business-dispute"].blocks[0].card_lead or siteContent.en.pages["business-dispute"].blocks[0].lead }}</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="en-situation-scene en-situation-scene--inheritance" aria-labelledby="situation-inheritance">
        <figure class="en-situation-image">{{ photo({src: '/approved-en-assets/photos/sit-3-900.jpg', srcset: '/approved-en-assets/photos/sit-3-900.jpg 900w', sizes: '(max-width: 700px) 94vw, 62vw', width: 900, height: 1500, alt: '', variant: 'scene', priority: 'lazy'}) }}</figure>
        <div class="en-situation-title-panel"><h3 id="situation-inheritance"><a href="/en/inheritance-conflict/">Inheritance conflict</a></h3>
          <p class="en-situation-description">{{ siteContent.en.pages["inheritance-conflict"].blocks[0].card_lead or siteContent.en.pages["inheritance-conflict"].blocks[0].lead }}</p></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="en-conversation" aria-labelledby="conversation-title">
    <div class="en-conversation-inner">
      <p class="en-conversation-benefit">Toza builds your protection around a personal threat model, hardens your devices and accounts, and teaches you the security practices fitted to your circumstances.</p>
      <p class="en-context-link"><a href="/en/how-it-works/">How Toza works</a></p>
      <h2 id="conversation-title">Start a private conversation.</h2>
      <p class="en-conversation-copy">The conversation does not commit you to purchase.</p>
      {% include "approved-en/messaging-actions.njk" %}
      {% include "approved-en/first-message.njk" %}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
